    <!-- isExposed=false: opened from JS by c/bovComparisonMatrix only, from BOTH
         its Select Broker and Replace Broker buttons (isFirstAppointment).
         ⚠ The description element below has a 255-CHARACTER CAP and only a
         deploy catches a breach - Jest, the SLDS linter and code review all
         pass a longer one. Measured 2026-08-21: 210 characters. -->
